SUMMARY:Part Closure: NORTHERN LINE: From 0130 Saturday 14 until 0130 
 Sunday 15 November\, no service between Euston (Bank Branch) / Charing 
 Cross and Morden / Battersea Power Station. There will be no Friday Night 
 Tube service between Charing Cross and Morden. Replacement bus services 
 operate during day hours only\, for Night journeys please use Night Bus 
 services
END:VEVENT
